# Security

This repository is a security demonstration. It intentionally contains
vulnerable implementations for educational purposes.

## Scope

The server is designed for local use only, over stdio transport, by a single
user. It is not intended for deployment, network exposure, or use as a
dependency.

## Intentional vulnerabilities

Commits at and before the `naive-baseline` tag contain deliberate
implementations of path traversal, SQL injection, and SSRF. These are the
subject of the demonstration, not defects.

## Reporting

If you find an unintentional issue — something outside the three documented
vulnerability classes — open an issue.
